WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.970
Today we will recognise pulse and respectful listening. Our work connects with

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.752
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:11.817
Listen to a short local rhythm and count its pulses.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:15.347
Echo the pulse by tapping softly four times.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:21.667
Perform the pulse with a partner, starting and stopping together. Justify a revision

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.998
using evidence from another world tradition.
